# CarBook Environment Configuration
#
# --- Google OAuth (required for "Sign in with Google") ---
# From https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials. The redirect URI
# below must also be registered as an "Authorized redirect URI" on the client.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3070/api/auth/callback/google

# --- Session signing (long random string; must be set in production) ---
JWT_SECRET=

# Optional Server-Side Managed AI Keys:
# - Leave empty for automatic free mode (uses SQLite persistent cache + master OEM knowledge base + automotive heuristics).
# - Or set your free Google AI Studio key (1,500 requests/day free tier) for live web lookup:
SERVER_GEMINI_API_KEY=
SERVER_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
